# ============================================================================
# NOVA TEST: tests/test_pure_self_hosting_backend.nv
# 100% Pure Nova Native Backend Verification Test Suite
# Tests: Linear Scan Allocator, AMD64 Opcode Emitter, ELF64, PE, Mach-O & WASM
